Other Pitfalls:
Small datasets
Blocking operations
Ordering requirements
Non-associative reduction
Shared common ForkJoinPool
Excessive task splitting
Interview Point:
Keep parallel Stream operations stateless, non-interfering, and free
from shared mutation.

EXPLANATION:
The biggest pitfall is modifying shared mutable state from multiple
worker threads.

